# Macs only (.chezmoiignore). SSH keys live in Bitwarden: its desktop app's SSH agent
# (Settings > SSH agent, "remember until vault is locked") signs, asking once per
# requesting app per unlock. Set here rather than through SSH_AUTH_SOCK so it also
# covers GUI apps and herdr, whose generated ssh config includes this file.
Match all
  IdentityAgent ~/.bitwarden-ssh-agent.sock
